                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Time management game in which you build and expand the prison on Alcatraz, managing workers, resources, and the completion of subsequent construction stages\n\n✅ Levels become increasingly difficult\n✅ Pleasant graphics and music\n✅ 50 levels, with 3 stars available on each level\n✅ Very good price for the game's content\n✅ The music perfectly matches the game's atmosphere\n✅ Historical facts about Alcatraz between levels add educational value\n✅ The graphics are decent\n✅ Resource and worker management are excellent\n✅ Additional challenges (bandits, thieves, pelicans blocking the path) add variety\n\n❌ To earn currency for upgrades, you have to replay previous levels and farm for resources\n❌ Lack of variety on the maps\n\n✅✅✅ Verdict: [strike] Terrible [/strike] , [strike] Bad [/strike] , [strike] Mediocre [/strike] , [strike] Decent [/strike] , [strike] Good [/strike] , [b] Very Good [/b] (Rating scale for short games, retro indie simulator games and similar)\n\n[quote] If you'd like to see more of my reviews, you can find them on my\ncurator page:\n[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45994324/admin/reviews_manage/]CuratorKingViking[/url]                                  \nand on my group:                                                \n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CuratorKingViking]GroupKingViking[/url]          \n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask.\nI'm happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!!\nBest regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer. [/quote]",
